// The rifle's sounds: a name the weapon plays, then the sound it plays. These are the IWAD's own
// (Doom 2 and Freedoom both have them); put your own files in sounds/weapons/rifle/ and name them
// here instead, like: spawnroom/rifle/fire sounds/weapons/rifle/fire

spawnroom/rifle/fire dspistol
spawnroom/rifle/out dsdbopn
spawnroom/rifle/in dsdbcls
